          <attvalue for="35" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A marked rise in global nominal yields increases outward capital pressure and borrowing costs, prompting Chinese authorities to tighten capital controls, tax audits, export restrictions and regulatory enforcement to preserve FX reserves and deter flight capital." />
