          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Sustained increases in sovereign yields raise public borrowing costs, prompting cuts or delays in maintenance and deterrent/upkeep programs that increase the vulnerability of critical infrastructure and thus the realized physical and functional damage during attacks." />
