          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Widening credit spreads raise borrowing and working-capital costs for shipping, charterers and energy firms, prompting expedited operational responses such as route avoidance, sailings suspensions and capacity reallocation to reduce cash burn." />
