          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Escalating coordinated economic, diplomatic and military pressure raises tail‑risk of wider conflict, prompting a flight‑to‑quality into core sovereign debt that increases demand and depresses nominal yields (especially at the short and intermediate maturities)." />
