          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Tighter fiscal/regulatory measures and capital controls (e.g., forced repatriation, sanctions on foreign subsidiaries) prompt accelerated withdrawals and forced deleveraging by foreign investors, creating large net outflows from affected assets and corresponding net inflows into perceived safe‑haven sovereign bonds." />
